WHO   — Quellek — the boy who believed By Grabthar's Hammer
WHAT  — The hinge of the film's heart: the believer whose sincere death finally lets Alexander Dane mean the line he'd despised.
WHERE — GQT · Galaxy Quest (1999)  Framework inputs: Galaxy Quest (1999, dir. Dean Parisot, DreamWorks); verified cast & facts  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the catchphrase needed someone to believe it completely for it to become true.
HOW   — By loving the role, serving 'Dr. Lazarus' faithfully, and dying with the line on his lips — and meaning it.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  By Grabthar's Hammer... by the Suns of Worvan... I shall be avenged. I always believed it, Dr. Lazarus. I always did.

